---
const steps = [
  {
    title: 'You give monthly',
    body: 'Choose an amount and set up a monthly EFT or debit order. Once-off gifts are welcome too.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Every Nation Southern Africa receives it',
    body: 'Your gift goes into the central ministry account, where it is receipted and accounted for. Nothing is paid into a personal account.',
  },
  {
    title: 'It is released as my salary',
    body: 'Every Nation pays it out as my ministry salary, which frees me to serve students on campus full-time.',
  },
];
---

<section id="partnership" class="section scroll-mt-4 bg-mist">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2
      data-split
      class="text-[clamp(32px,5.5vw,54px)] leading-[1.12] font-bold text-navy"
    >
      How the partnership works
    </h2>

    <span data-reveal data-reveal-delay="100" class="rule mt-6 mb-[18px]"></span>

    <p
      data-reveal
      data-reveal-delay="160"
      class="mb-11 max-w-[60ch] text-[clamp(15px,1.8vw,17.5px)] leading-[1.65] text-ink"
    >
      Ministry interns raise their own support. Every gift follows one
      accountable route, so you always know where your giving goes.
    </p>

    <ol class="flex flex-wrap gap-[18px]">
      {
        steps.map((step, i) => (
          <li
            data-reveal
            data-reveal-delay={i * 120}
            class="min-w-[250px] flex-1 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white px-[26px] py-7 transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-300 ease-out-soft hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_14px_40px_rgb(20_34_92/0.1)]"
          >
            <span class="index-num" aria-hidden="true">
              {String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
            </span>
            <h3 class="mt-3.5 mb-2 font-body text-[18px] font-bold text-navy">
              {step.title}
            </h3>
            <p class="text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-[#444444]">{step.body}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>

    <p
      data-reveal
      class="mt-7 max-w-[64ch] text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-soft"
    >
      Partners receive updates on the ministry, and you can pause or change your
      giving at any time.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
